AI Content Creation Cohort 2: Full Curriculum
Vixora Academy · 10 weeks · Draft v1 for review
Course Overview
This hands-on course teaches students to create professional content with AI tools: written posts, images, video, voiceovers and short-form clips. Students learn content strategy, build a repeatable production system, and finish with a personal brand and portfolio they can use to attract followers, clients or employers.
* Duration: 10 weeks
* Format: Online / Physical (hybrid)
* Level: Beginner (no design or editing experience required)
* Pricing: ₦30,000
* Certificate: Awarded on completion of the final project
Learning Outcomes
By the end of the course, students will be able to:
* Choose a niche and understand their audience
* Write captions, scripts, blogs and ad copy with AI, in their own voice
* Design graphics and images with AI tools and Canva
* Create and edit short videos with AI and CapCut
* Produce voiceovers, audio and music with AI
* Plan, batch-produce and schedule a month of content
* Build a personal brand and a portfolio
* Package content services for clients and earn from them
Tools Used
ChatGPT, Claude and Gemini (writing and ideas), Canva (design), AI image generators, AI video and avatar tools, CapCut (editing), AI voice and music tools, and scheduling tools. Specific tools may change as the field moves, and free options are used wherever possible.
Course Structure
* Phase 1: Foundations (Weeks 1-2): content basics, AI writing and prompting
* Phase 2: Visual and Video Content (Weeks 3-6): images, video, editing, audio
* Phase 3: Strategy and Production (Weeks 7-8): social media strategy, short-form content, calendars and batching
* Phase 4: Brand and Career (Weeks 9-10): personal brand, portfolio, monetization
Assessment (Proposed)
* Weekly content assignments
* Mid-course review of a content set (written, image and short video)
* Final project: a 30-day content plan with a complete first week of finished content
* Certificate issued on completing all weekly deliverables and the final project
